 "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CjU-Nl9K7hkQ7kNvwGJDLQW&_nc_oc=Adly_jZ07PB3nP4cSld_wLOqFA6LMIoYks3SeDOb-o8fM3NOPUHqgqqFKhlGx41elc4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyaHMk76rPIr3Qt1cCCV9wurD-XUj5hpka6iFHE7Y5uSw&oe=69AD58B9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v786hzfNU_cQ7kNvwEVEdvS&_nc_oc=AdkSXqTLTc28JlAP1oP4UP8Qjh0XY5ab1XGruMf0RnIbhj8ebgDFAj5pLYGhC7hVHvE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxSpAA5aS39puJDn-zr3difwkY77j5DlpR-KuwEisfcgw&oe=69AD6853"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m0iGwp34M98Q7kNvwGjrCJm&_nc_oc=AdkxfwWk9IcM4f5BvE2_BeYsNbII4i25EVbteXEudCifziJFjd1D0me5h0pKLYBsZgA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwgV6cphPl4axPWvqtvm--DbG0bRnEybC0WN2cWNCPL-A&oe=69AD73FB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YzROl26gkyEQ7kNvwFFvsvF&_nc_oc=AdkTNhWAswhkFHTF2g8CguEZFGrNCr9hVeOUIcWDzq1K5JYmLrrUwdECvmC4NkgCqRc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxGEOHB8PBf2OuYyWQY_46Yip4g4fI0J6WbNHEuQy-vbg&oe=69AD754A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JXwUf3WMp-kQ7kNvwFQFHOS&_nc_oc=AdnOcK3fVGG-MSA08UnYByAo9z-T8bC_Oy01o8hD-pioEgrINgKVQKyu7o1kUKsx5PI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzrcIrjgipFdus9gSTWKxbt2QBoF09HBP2N7z7IdUKQDQ&oe=69AD5E7E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Aerodrums", "supp